  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fifth Health Sector Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve patients&apos; and health workers&apos; safety in hospitals in Mongolia. It will (i) improve the safety of blood transfusions, (ii) strengthen medical waste management, and (iii) prevent and control hospital acquired infections. It complements previous Asian Development Bank (ADB) initiatives in the health sector in Mongolia.</narrative>
  </description>
